{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369280/extras/0b59ce7eeedbacc10a041bb6acc0920d.avif?t=1759416489\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369280/extras_big/0b59ce7eeedbacc10a041bb6acc0920d.avif?t=1759416489 width=800 height=250 /></span><strong>Welcome to <i>Nightlife</i>, the dating sim and pub management game where you'll follow the story of Greg Kingsley \u2014 the best bartender in town!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a cozy nightlife bar and dive into a world full of choices, romance, and secrets served over drinks. Meet unique customers, chat, flirt, mix cocktails\u2026 and discover how every decision can change your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending management gameplay with visual novel storytelling, <i>Nightlife</i> challenges you not only to run your business successfully but also to uncover the secrets, desires, and emotions hidden behind every girl who walks through your pub\u2019s door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369280/extras/f7db370d4a91441da8172bee73a4a019.avif?t=1759416489\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369280/extras_big/f7db370d4a91441da8172bee73a4a019.avif?t=1759416489 width=800 height=443 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pub Management</strong>: Buy drinks, upgrade decor, and manage your resources to attract more customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adult Dating Sim</strong>: Meet deep, unique characters with different personalities and romantic routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Based System</strong>: Your decisions impact relationships, events, and endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylish Nightlife Vibe</strong>: Anime-inspired visuals and a cozy, seductive atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Narrative</strong>: Multiple storylines to explore based on your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adult Content</strong>: Unlock romantic, suggestive scenes as you progress through the story.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Presentation:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nadine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369280/extras/6d0a841b36874b6088645264eb2ee518.avif?t=1759416489\" width=800 height=800 /></span>An enthusiastic heroine with a complicated past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valetine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369280/extras/81e970f51f57aa4886f652e9536aabc5.avif?t=1759416489\" width=800 height=800 /></span>A proud tsundere with emotions close to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sofia</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369280/extras/001e580e41d151aee3887850905e5868.avif?t=1759416489\" width=800 height=800 /></span>Local caf\u00e9 worker, frustrated in love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bunny</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369280/extras/6f16b2cecec96ffa9350534d5d0bcac2.avif?t=1759416489\" width=800 height=800 /